\\f0\\b \\cf2 \\cb3 \\strokec2 ### `src/make_figures.py`\
\\f1\\b0 \\cf4 \\cb1 \\strokec4 \\\
\\\
\\pard\\pardeftab720\\partightenfactor0\
\\cf4 \\cb3 A standalone script that re-derives the same per-element accuracy statistics from the\\cb1 \\\
\\cb3 workbook and renders publication-style figures (Arial, Okabe-Ito colorblind-safe palette,\\cb1 \\\
\\cb3 grayscale-safe markers, error bars + significance + n, bold panel labels). Output:\\cb1 \\\
