\\cf5 \\cb3 \\strokec5 -\\cf4 \\strokec4  \\cf2 \\strokec2 `figure2_missingness`\\cf4 \\strokec4  - percent-missing bars + case-by-element pattern\\cb1 \\\
\\cf5 \\cb3 \\strokec5 -\\cf4 \\strokec4  \\cf2 \\strokec2 `figureS1_grouped_bar`\\cf4 \\strokec4  - supplemental grouped bar chart\\cb1 \\\
\\cf5 \\cb3 \\strokec5 -\\cf4 \\strokec4  \\cf2 \\strokec2 `figure_source_data.csv`\\cf4 \\strokec4  - the underlying statistics for each figure\\cb1 \\\
