\\f0\\b \\cf2 \\cb3 \\strokec2 ### `src/missing_data_classification.py`\
\\f1\\b0 \\cf4 \\cb1 \\strokec4 \\\
\\\
\\pard\\pardeftab720\\partightenfactor0\
\\cf4 \\cb3 A self-contained CLI utility that classifies the missingness mechanism of any tabular\\cb1 \\\
\\cb3 dataset (CSV or Excel). Implements a simplified Little's MCAR test,\\cb1 \\\
\\cb3 point-biserial missingness-indicator correlations for MAR detection, and a KS-based\\cb1 \\\
\\cb3 tail heuristic for MNAR detection. Emits a per-column classification report plus\\cb1 \\\
\\cb3 supporting CSVs to a specified output directory.\\cb1 \\\
\\\
\\pard\\pardeftab720\\partightenfactor0\
\
