\\pard\\pardeftab720\\partightenfactor0\
\\cf4 \\cb3 A self-contained static dashboard presenting the accuracy comparison, test results, and\\cb1 \\\
\\cb3 missingness as an interactive HTML page. Its per-element numbers are \
\\f0\\b \\cf6 \\strokec6 **hardcoded**\
\\f1\\b0 \\cf4 \\strokec4  as a\\cb1 \\\
\\cb3 point-in-time snapshot; it does not read from the pipeline at runtime, so figures can\\cb1 \\\
